{"id":"03af5095ed087251","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-iota-operator.md","title":"Iota Operator and Definitional Description","display":"df-iota-operator — Iota Operator and Definitional Description","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-iota-operator","aliases":["88-df-iota-operator"],"display":"df-iota-operator — Iota Operator and Definitional Description","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-substitution]]","[[88-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-iota-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-iota-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iota-operator — Iota Operator and Definitional Description"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是<strong>逐公式的定义模式</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是背景一阶理论的签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>；该理论含有指定默认对象的常量项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\">\\(c_0\\)</span>。本册元数学使用 ZFC，默认对象取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\}=\\mathrm{free}_L(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(\\{p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\}=\\mathrm{free}_L(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>；公式、变量与自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec p=(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)\">\\(\\vec p=(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)\\)</span> 是按指定顺序列出的参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\">\\(y,z\\)</span> 是彼此不同且未在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 中出现的新变量，也不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\vec p\">\\(x,\\vec p\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi[y/x],\\phi[z/x]\">\\(\\phi[y/x],\\phi[z/x]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a> 的自由代入；上述新鲜性保证其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L\\)</span> 条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(c_0\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\">\\(U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\">\\(D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\\)</span> 是下述公式缩写，不是未解释的真谓词。</li>\n<li>对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,\\phi,\\vec p)\">\\((x,\\phi,\\vec p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{x,\\phi}\">\\(d_{x,\\phi}\\)</span> 是一个不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sym}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> 的新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元函数符号（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时为常量）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota x\\,\\phi\">\\(\\iota x\\,\\phi\\)</span> 是本文件定义的唯一描述绑定记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^+\">\\(L^+\\)</span> 是下述加入该函数的签名；签名分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>。扩张沿用原变量字母表（同下标变量规范识别）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a> 的项变量映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\nL^+\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\{d_{x,\\phi}\\},\n(\\mathrm{Func}_L^n)_{n\\geq1},(\\mathrm{Rel}_L^n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle,&amp;k=0,\\\\\n\\langle\\mathrm{Const}_L,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_L^n\\cup\\{d_{x,\\phi}:n=k\\})_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_L^n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle,&amp;k\\geq1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\nL^+\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\{d_{x,\\phi}\\},\n(\\mathrm{Func}_L^n)_{n\\geq1},(\\mathrm{Rel}_L^n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle,&amp;k=0,\\\\\n\\langle\\mathrm{Const}_L,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_L^n\\cup\\{d_{x,\\phi}:n=k\\})_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_L^n)_{n\\geq1}\\rangle,&amp;k\\geq1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nU_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists x\\,\\bigl(\\phi\\land\\forall z\\,(\\phi[z/x]\\to z=x)\\bigr),\\\\\nD_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\land\\phi[y/x]\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\neg U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\land y=c_0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\,\\phi&amp;\\coloneqq U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nU_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists x\\,\\bigl(\\phi\\land\\forall z\\,(\\phi[z/x]\\to z=x)\\bigr),\\\\\nD_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\land\\phi[y/x]\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\neg U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\land y=c_0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\,\\phi&amp;\\coloneqq U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec p\\;\\exists!y\\;D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec p\\;\\exists!y\\;D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec p\\;\\forall y\\;\n\\bigl(d_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)=y\\leftrightarrow D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec p\\;\\forall y\\;\n\\bigl(d_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)=y\\leftrightarrow D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\iota x\\,\\phi\\;\\coloneqq\\;d_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\iota x\\,\\phi\\;\\coloneqq\\;d_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L^+}\n\\land\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\n=\\mathrm{free}_L(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L^+}\n\\land\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\n=\\mathrm{free}_L(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\left[\\exists!x\\,\\phi\\to\n\\forall y\\,\\bigl((\\iota x\\,\\phi)=y\\leftrightarrow\\phi[y/x]\\bigr)\\right],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\left[\\neg\\exists!x\\,\\phi\\to(\\iota x\\,\\phi)=c_0\\right],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\bigl((\\iota x\\,\\phi)=(\\iota z\\,\\phi[z/x])\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iota\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\left[\\exists!x\\,\\phi\\to\n\\forall y\\,\\bigl((\\iota x\\,\\phi)=y\\leftrightarrow\\phi[y/x]\\bigr)\\right],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\left[\\neg\\exists!x\\,\\phi\\to(\\iota x\\,\\phi)=c_0\\right],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec p\\;\\bigl((\\iota x\\,\\phi)=(\\iota z\\,\\phi[z/x])\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{x,\\phi}\">\\(U_{x,\\phi}\\)</span> 是否成立分情况：成立时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的唯一值是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 的唯一见证；不成立时唯一值是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\">\\(c_0\\)</span>。因此定义公理引入的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{x,\\phi}\">\\(d_{x,\\phi}\\)</span> 都有唯一解释，扩张对原语言保守。参数恰好列出除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 外的全部自由变量；绑定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不作为函数的参数。由扩张后项的变量递归定义，得到显示的变量集合等式。新鲜变量改名不改变结果，最后一个断言正式记录这一点。</p>\n<p>这是带默认值的总化唯一描述约定，<strong>不是</strong>在多个见证中作选择的 Hilbert epsilon 算子。不存在唯一见证时不能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\">\\(\\phi(\\iota x\\,\\phi)\\)</span>。本册用描述项定义量词秩和超算术层级时，必须另行证明相应的存在唯一性，不能借默认值跳过该证明。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 在此是外部模式参数，不是在同一个一阶公式内部量化的“公式对象”。对于本册的元数学描述，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是背景集合论语言；该模式不会默默把描述项加入每一个被研究的对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，因而不改写 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"88-df-term\">88-df-term</a> 的对象语言生成规则。嵌套描述按从内到外的次序用图公式消去。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a72f024d8daeb569","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4