mathrm{FreeFor}_L$ 条件。$c_0\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 见 [[88-df-term]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^+$ 是下述加入该函数的签名；签名分量见 [[88-df-symbol]]。扩张沿用原变量字母表（同下标变量规范识别）；$\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}$ 是 [[88-df-free-variable]] 的项变量映射。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^+$ 是下述加入该函数的签名；签名分量见 [[88-df-symbol]]。扩张沿用原变量字母表（同下标变量规范识别）；$\\mathrm{var}_{L^+}$ 是 [[88-df-free-variable]] 的项变量映射。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\phi$ 在此是外部模式参数，不是在同一个一阶公式内部量化的“公式对象”。对于本册的元数学描述，$L$ 是背景集合论语言；该模式不会默默把描述项加入每一个被研究的对象语言 $S$，因而不改写 [[88-df-term]] 的对象语言生成规则。嵌套描述按从内到外的次序用图公式消去。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"c_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"x,p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\{p_1,\\ldots,p_k\\}=\\mathrm{free}_L(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec p=(p_1,\\ldots,p_k)","display":false},{"tex":"y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"x,\\vec p","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi[y/x],\\phi[z/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L","display":false},{"tex":"c_0\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"U_{x,\\phi}(\\vec p)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{x,\\phi}(y,\\vec p)","display":false},{"tex":"(x,\\phi,\\vec p)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{x,\\phi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sym}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_L","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota x\\,\\phi","